4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ElnoTLnZMaIQ7kNvwHTuW1S&_nc_oc=AdqGsIJVYyRR0mIB6YTuppc4shFwQTjQoZ13NEBj1KVPBbGQ7k6pxvbbXLzAhS7sAKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0FvODvFhH_Ll4Ec-G4DOASC5XS0iHe-5ppV1615pfvHg&oe=69F89954"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SYpsw-24QGIQ7kNvwF4FMFK&_nc_oc=Adrw0TP6o8Q7GIaBtIc-l4cuT4V-_mrMgmEOnfd1F91L0jbrUb_Q1eL8hWd_1fKo_8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0WYfxILeVauUDY-D3ZivVWPA5pQmZLlKisYjpZXk8oVQ&oe=69F89E32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k25jMnHuoQ0Q7kNvwEu-nox&_nc_oc=Adr4E8_nLMbkiGOXw2kdiZa6LjlbyEJHpDH0j91MTvRNe-l4raxehtpejLIgFrunUCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0rqd-oWg0Qtjz4t9KO7088QhY9HVOysJ7XpfmnhjSXbg&oe=69F8ABD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p